/**
 * Icon — a single, consistent set of stroke icons (Lucide) used across the UI in
 * place of emoji, for a crisp, premium, cross-platform look. Inline SVG so it is
 * themeable via currentColor and adds zero network requests.
 *
 * Registries store a semantic icon name (e.g. 'wallet'); pass it as `name`.
 * Paths are inlined from lucide-static (ISC licensed).
 */
